WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.440
Come with me to reinforce the East Gate.

00:02.520 --> 00:04.080
The Wunu have been besieging three sides, leaving one open.

00:04.160 --> 00:04.640
Right now,

00:04.720 --> 00:05.960
The north and west are under attack,

00:06.040 --> 00:07.320
Yet the east remains quiet.

00:07.400 --> 00:07.960
They're likely waiting

00:08.040 --> 00:09.440
For us to pull our defenders from the east

00:09.520 --> 00:10.920
To reinforce elsewhere,

00:11.360 --> 00:12.760
Before attacking the east.

00:12.840 --> 00:13.640
Move!

00:13.720 --> 00:14.480
To the east wall!

00:14.600 --> 00:15.640
Yes, sir!

00:18.000 --> 00:26.500
You rushed with your men to the East Gate. After guarding it on high alert for a long while without any sign of enemy presence, thunderous battle cries suddenly erupted from the West Gate—Shi Lang's main army had already breached the city.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.000
Fire! It's a fire!

00:29.500 --> 00:30.800
Over here!

00:31.000 --> 00:32.200
Over here!

00:32.400 --> 00:33.400
Need two more men!

00:33.500 --> 00:34.500
Over here!

00:34.600 --> 00:35.800
What happened?!

00:35.900 --> 00:37.000
Brother-in-law, run!

00:37.000 --> 00:38.200
The southern granary is ablaze!

00:38.280 --> 00:39.500
Yiyang cannot hold!

00:39.600 --> 00:40.500
Come on!

00:40.600 --> 00:41.500
Faster! Faster!

00:41.500 --> 00:43.000
If even I flee now,

00:43.400 --> 00:45.100
Who will dare fight the Wunu to the death?!

00:45.200 --> 00:46.100
Bring more water over here!

00:46.160 --> 00:47.500
What's more,

00:47.800 --> 00:49.300
With the swift speed of Wunu cavalry,

00:49.400 --> 00:50.800
Even if we abandon the city,

00:51.600 --> 00:53.000
Could we truly escape?!

00:53.500 --> 00:55.000
If we tell everyone to scatter and run,

00:55.000 --> 00:56.400
There might still be a chance!

00:56.500 --> 00:58.200
Even if brother-in-law doesn't care for his own life,

00:58.300 --> 01:00.500
You must at least think of my sister and your young heir!

01:00.800 --> 01:02.000
Hurry up!

01:14.000 --> 01:28.000
In the twenty-fourth year of Yuankang, Emperor Xuan Sikong Jing passed away, and Prince of Ning Sikong Zheng ascended the throne. He bestowed upon the Prince of Jin the title of 'Prince of Leisure', easing house arrest into surveillance. Thenceforth, amid golden pavilions and willow-lined riverbanks, you were left to live out your days in carefree leisure.
